EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi {!PTO_Request__c.Approver__c},

{!PTO_Request__c.Employee__c} has requested time off and needs your approval.

Request: {!PTO_Request__c.Name}
Dates: {!PTO_Request__c.Start_Date__c} to {!PTO_Request__c.End_Date__c}
Days: {!PTO_Request__c.Day_Count__c}
Total hours: {!PTO_Request__c.Total_Hours__c}
PTO Reason: {!PTO_Request__c.Notes__c}

Approve or reject it in Salesforce: {!PTO_Request__c.PTO_Tab_Link__c}&c__section=approve
